    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §57-0107, En Con L",
    "lawSection": "Environmental Conservation Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S5516\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to the\ncentral pine barrens area and the core preservation area\n\nPURPOSE:\n\nTo correct the description of acreage added to the central pine barrens\narea and the core preservation area by Chapter 240 of the Laws of 2013.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nChapter 240 of the Laws of 2013 added the area known as the Carmans\nRiver Watershed to the Pine Barrens Preserve located in eastern Long\nIsland. The area added consisted of approximately 3875 total acres with\n1660 acres thereof in the core area. Those areas were particularly\ndescribed in that Chapter. This bill amends subdivision 10 and 11 of\nsection 510107 of the environmental conservation law to make corrections\nand clarifications to those descriptions.\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe bill is correcting the description in the prior legislation.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nImmediately.\n\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
